  "details": "Log messages like \"The referenced script on this Behaviour (Game Object 'AreaLight') is missing!\" write arbitrary text into the output log (in this case using GameObject names).\n\nThis makes it possible for malicious users to write messages in the format of VRChat log messages which can cause issues for applications that rely on the output log to gather information.\n\nThis could be stopped using a custom Logger or LogHandler to replace line breaks and other characters that might be problematic.\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/ILogger.html\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/ILogHandler.html",
